; --- The 2026-08-28 layout rebuild: eight more pines, rocks and pillars. The cell had four trees and two rock clusters on
; --- 2,500 m2, which is not a wilderness — it is a floor with props on it. These build the three
; --- places the forked road exists to serve: the Hollow Bowl in the west (encounter ground with a
; --- rock rim), the Deadfall in the east (a pine thicket to be ambushed in), and Cairn Rise in the
; --- north-west, the one landmark visible from anywhere in the cell.
